+# Task 2 Final Report: Evidence Normalization and Upgrade Gate
+
+## Final status
+
+Complete after two review-remediation rounds.
+
+Commits:
+
+- `3bf0e5d9 feat: enforce embodied evidence upgrade gates`
+- `10b85e72 fix: harden embodied evidence verification`
+- `384d8c35 fix: enforce trusted evidence identities`
+
+## Final behavior
+
+- Sources are classified S/A/B/C/D with unknown sources failing safe to D.
+- Evidence is whitespace-normalized and fingerprinted as
+  `v1:<sha256>` with an explicit `fingerprint_version` contract.
+- Automatic verification is evaluated independently per `node_id`.
+- One clear, current S-grade item can verify a node. Two A-grade items can
+  verify it only when they have two distinct, non-empty trusted
+  `publisher_id`/`canonical_source_id` identities. Free-form crawl `source_id`
+  never supplies an A vote identity.
+- `publisher_id`, `canonical_source_id`, `node_id`, and `source_url` are stripped;
+  empty optional values normalize to `None`.
+- Future, expired, and explicitly invalid evidence cannot upgrade. Callers may
+  supply `as_of`; no arbitrary universal history window is imposed.
+- Relation and stage phrases are evaluated sentence-by-sentence and keyword-by-
+  keyword with local negation windows. Forms including `未量产`, `未交付`,
+  `无订单`, `尚无订单`, `并未向客户供应`, and `不存在任何相关订单`
+  neither establish an explicit relation nor advance commercialization stage.
+  A positive counterexample (`不但已量产，而且已批量交付`) remains affirmative.
+- Vague sentences cannot be unlocked by unrelated `主营`/`收入` text.
+- Framework agreements and generic capacity release do not overstate stage.
+  A stated revenue-share percentage reaches at most revenue recognition;
+  `SIGNIFICANT_REVENUE_SHARE` additionally requires explicit significant/large
+  improvement wording plus a percentage.
+- Task 2 produces ordered stage candidates only; it never confirms an automatic
+  downgrade.
+
+## TDD evidence
+
+- Initial RED: missing evidence module (`ModuleNotFoundError`, exit 2).
+- Vague-supply RED: `可用于...供应链` was incorrectly explicit (`1 failed`).
+- First review RED: missing fingerprint contract (collection error, exit 2).
+- Valid-alias RED: `valid=False` was not accepted (`1 failed`).
+- Second review RED: four failures exposed local negation, crawl-ID voting,
+  optional-string normalization, and revenue-share overstatement.
+- Negation-window RED: `并未向客户供应` remained explicit (`1 failed`).
+- Each RED was followed by a focused GREEN before proceeding.
+
+## Fresh final verification
+
+- `bash tools/codex-lowio.sh py tools/tests/test_embodied_refresh_evidence.py -q`
+  -> `19 passed`.
+- `bash tools/codex-lowio.sh py tools/tests/test_embodied_refresh_repository.py -q`
