+
+### Fixes
+
+- Conflict pairing now emits every and only unequal `(existing_node, proposed_node)` combination. Matching nodes never self-conflict, multiple existing nodes are fully represented, and a multi-proposed batch without an existing mapping is explicitly persisted as `batch_ambiguity` with nullable existing node/mapping.
